            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.12+JOS.1.13+JOS.1.14+JOS.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoc. 1.12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dok rik acikowu i kare-nono kun akobo ni, ‘Rwot Obaŋawu doŋ otyeko miyowu lobo man oko me bed megwu. Jowu luŋ a tek i lweny bino ruko jami lwenygi kato kede loka ca i nyim omegowu, ame gin jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cite monwu kede itinowu atino kede limwu akwo, (pien aŋeo ni itye wunu i lwak lim apipim), gin bino doŋ i boma ame doŋ aminowu-ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tuno wan a Rwot doŋ omio omegowu ka weo, kite ame omiowu kede ka weo-ni, ame gin daŋ doŋ onwoŋo lobogi ame Rwot Obaŋawu bino miyogi loka Jordan; icennere wun doŋ ibino dwogo wunu kun ŋat acel acel dwogo i lobo mere a doŋ amiowu-ni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare-naca rik aciko Yocwa ni, ‘Yin doŋ ityeko neno i waŋi ginnoro luŋ ame Rwot Obaŋawu otyeko tiyo i kom obakki aryo ca; Rwot dok bino timo kittono i kom loc luŋ ame ibino tuno wunu iye ka ikato wunu loka ca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kur ilwor wunugi, pien Rwot Obaŋawu en ame tye ka lweny pirwu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
